(### 7. Technical Components) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The following reference numerals identify the principal components of the illustrative system.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (| Reference numeral | Component | Function |) Tj
T* (|---|---|---|) Tj
T* (| 100 | User Interface | Receives document access requests and displays access outcomes. |) Tj
T* (| 110 | Access Request Processor | Receives and processes access request information. |) Tj
T* (| 120 | Identity and Permission Verification Module | Verifies authentication status and retrieves applicable) Tj
T* (permissions. |) Tj
T* (| 130 | Contextual Data Collection Module | Collects relevant security and access-context information. |) Tj
T* (| 140 | Risk Assessment Engine | Evaluates contextual information and generates a risk assessment. |) Tj
T* (| 150 | Access Control Decision Engine | Determines the access action according to risk and policy. |) Tj
T* (| 160 | Document Access Enforcement Module | Enforces the access decision. |) Tj
T* (| 170 | Document Repository | Stores or provides access to protected digital documents. |) Tj
T* (| 180 | Audit Logging Module | Records access events, assessment results, and decisions. |) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (#### Computational and Communication Elements) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The system may additionally comprise one or more processors, memory devices, persistent storage, network) Tj
T* (interfaces, and communication channels configured to execute the software modules and exchange information) Tj
T* (between them.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The processors execute instructions stored in memory. The memory stores program instructions, configuration) Tj
T* (parameters, access policies, and temporary processing data. Persistent storage may maintain document metadata,) Tj
T* (access records, and audit logs. Communication interfaces may enable interaction with external authentication) Tj
T* (providers, document repositories, and enterprise identity services.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (These supporting computing elements are implementation-dependent and should be assigned separate reference) Tj
T* (numerals in the final drawings if they are important to understanding the claimed invention.) Tj
